    "title": "Gallery to host open house June 14 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Hanks ,\n18 hours ago The Minnesota Valley Chapter of the Izaak Walton League in Bloomington will host an open house this weekend for a photography and video exhibit featuring the vital connection of water on land that was and is traditional Dakota homeland\nThe open house for the photographer John Kellen’s gallery exhibit is 1-4 p.m. Sunday, June 14, at the Minnesota Valley’s chapter house, 6601 Auto Club Road.\nThe opening reception will feature a Dakota blessing ceremony and a selection of Indigenous foods.\nPrivate tours and group showings are available by contacting the gallery.\nInfo: koubagallery.org",
